TI  - The effect of Flipped Classroom through Near Peer Education (FC through NPE) on patient safety knowledge retention in nursing and midwifery students: a solomon four-group design
AU  - Sima poormahdi golaki
AU  - Farahnaz Kamali
AU  - Razieh Bagherzadeh
AU  - Fatemeh Hajinejad
