TI  - Effectiveness of the flipped classroom methodology on the learning of evidence-based practice of nursing students: Quasi-experimental design
AU  - María Ruzafa‐Martínez
AU  - Alonso Molina‐Rodríguez
AU  - Verónica Pérez-Muñoz
AU  - César Leal‐Costa
AU  - Antonio Jesús Ramos‐Morcillo
