TI  - Effect of evidence-based education program with mentoring system for prevention of ventilator-associated pneumonia on nurses’ competency to improve quality care for patients in the intensive care unit: a quasi-experimental study in a tertiary hospital in Bangladesh
AU  - Nahida Akhter
AU  - Xintong Zhou
AU  - Sameh Elhabashy
AU  - K. A. T. M. Ehsanul Huq
AU  - Miho Okamoto
AU  - Abdul Basit
AU  - Abdulfatai Olamilekan Babaita
AU  - Michiko Moriyama
