TI  - Evaluation on a teaching software for removable partial denture framework design
AU  - Zhijuan Luo
AU  - Yunhong Lin
AU  - Yin Yi
AU  - Ting Zhou
AU  - Xingxing Li
JO  - Technology and Health Care
PY  - 2023
VL  - 31
